Usage: star-escrow [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init                 
  pause                
  unpause              
  create               
  submit-work          
  transfer-freelancer  
  approve              
  cancel               
  expire               
  status               
  list                 
  verify               
  help                 Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <FILE>                            
      --network <NETWORK>                        [possible values: testnet, mainnet, futurenet]
      --rpc-url <RPC_URL>                        
      --network-passphrase <NETWORK_PASSPHRASE>  
      --json                                     
      --dry-run                                  
      --no-confirm                               
      --verbose                                  
  -h, --help                                     Print help
  -V, --version                                  Print version
